{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（14日）9時51分，警方接獲多人報案，指秀茂坪寶達邨對開，一輛的士撞倒一名男途人，事主倒地陷入半昏迷。救援人員到場，將事主送往伊利沙伯醫院搶救。警方在調查事故成因。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場遺下血漬。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176120097366872064856109.jpeg/KM2H7iLMliTq1dybuZsXPW6OtzyF4jT1VB0QAnEdEAI\"/><figcaption>現場遺下血漬。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事小露寳。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176119706738757632694035.jpeg/b_cATL0hkJ2NNnprFyqjXQC3fo-qp-K_0izSZvcs0mY\"/><figcaption>涉事小露寳。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小露寳車頭撞凹。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176119709431631872076295.jpeg/D2yPnZNBO-8TFIbP-Sw4n2PIBDLXv6gFsLY1GJW2NRg\"/><figcaption>小露寳車頭撞凹。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"交通警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176119712208392192346209.jpeg/_4QvcslXinO2wwer_i24suiSAyZ_57LEIhLNTAcSzUw\"/><figcaption>交通警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"交通警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176119714985152512412076.jpeg/7OLZ-MPk9rsoEudM3x-H030jS21INbAyK9-v8A7fr_A\"/><figcaption>交通警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事小露寳停在路中。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176120978195877888901652.jpeg/rZBsOrPYtsltrfsUXw0iOdS4so_LXZt4wAH7a-UB-2s\"/><figcaption>涉事小露寳停在路中。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場遺下血漬。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176120980402212864934168.jpeg/QWmJbt_VJzL6zRYbDId1TJFKroq4CCY_9u7isdPu4rE\"/><figcaption>現場遺下血漬。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主被送往伊利沙伯醫院搶救。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176116163617361920462170.jpeg/GkAonBORUpKZVsFet03chKbTJ1NaKPb2ZXzsCUB87Ak\"/><figcaption>事主被送往伊利沙伯醫院搶救。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T02:58:19.084689+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":8,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}